<title>USA: Duff &amp; Phelps downgrades Browning-Ferris.</title>
<headline>Duff &amp; Phelps downgrades Browning-Ferris.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said it downgraded the debt ratings on the senior unsecured debt of Browning-Ferris Industries Inc to Single A Minus from Single A.</p>
<p>The commercial paper rating also was downgraded to D One Minus from Duff One.  </p>
<p>The revised senior debt rating includes all senior notes, debentures, medium-term notes and solid waste revenue bonds guaranteed by Browning-Ferris, a solid and liquid waste management company.</p>
<p>The action follows recent weak operating results at the company and expectations that a return to prior operating and leverage measuremets will be a long-term challenge for the company, Duff &amp; Phelps said.</p>
<p>Browning-Ferris was trading at 26-1/2, off 1/4.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
